Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: register FPC prefix and clean K7 example

Register Fingerprint Cards AB as the owner of the fpc vendor prefix used
by the disabled SPES compatibility node. Also remove unit addresses from
the K7 binding example nodes that intentionally have no reg properties.

This patch is a draft to apply after the SPES port patch. It does not
enable the FPC node or fingerprint driver.

---

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
index 55a27f595..6c14f4a39 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
@@ -622,6 +622,8 @@ patternProperties:
     description: Shanghai FourSemi Semiconductor Co.,Ltd.
   "^foxlink,.*":
     description: Foxlink Group
+  "^fpc,.*":
+    description: Fingerprint Cards AB
   "^freebox,.*":
     description: Freebox SAS
   "^freecom,.*":